flowchart TB
  S[Seed problems]:::inp --> G[Model generates<br/>chain-of-thought]:::proc
  G --> C{Final answer<br/>correct?}:::proc
  C -- yes --> K[Keep correct trace]:::good
  C -- no --> R["Rationalize: re-prompt WITH<br/>the gold answer to produce<br/>a justifying trace"]:::bad
  K --> P[Pool: correct +<br/>rationalized traces]:::spec
  R --> P
  P --> F[Fine-tune model]:::proc
  F -. "iteration k+1: each round solves more,<br/>generating more training data" .-> G

  classDef inp  fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1e88e5,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0d47a1;
  classDef good fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#43a047,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1b5e20;
  classDef bad  fill:#ffebee,stroke:#e53935,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#b71c1c;
  classDef proc fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#fb8c00,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#e65100;
  classDef spec fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#8e24aa,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#4a148c;
